CLIENT LAUNCHER
The optional WarcraftCSLauncher.exe is compiled from this project's C# source and
embeds only an audited source ZIP plus existing project notices. It does not bundle
game data, Python, NumPy, Microsoft build tools, MinHook binaries or .NET libraries.
It uses Windows' .NET Framework and PowerShell. After explicit user consent it may
download the PSF Python installer (Python license), NumPy (BSD-3-Clause), signed
Microsoft Build Tools/Windows SDK (Microsoft terms) and pinned MinHook (BSD-2-Clause).
Those dependencies are installed separately and retain their upstream licenses.
The launcher also checks the project's GitHub release metadata and, with current or
saved explicit automatic-update permission, downloads SHA256-verified project source
and launcher assets. Original game files and owner-provided models remain local.
Warcraft's redist/miles codecs and providers are read from the owner's installation
and copied only into their private runtime. They are not embedded, downloaded or redistributed.
